* ============================================================
* AD8551 Non-Inverting Amplifier, Gain = 100 V/V (40 dB)
* Single +5 V supply, mid-supply (2.5 V) referenced
* Input: 10 mV amplitude sine @ 1 kHz (riding on 2.5 V bias)
* ============================================================

* --- Genuine Analog Devices AD8551 macromodel ---
* (ADI model file, subckt pin order: +IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT)
.include AD8551.cir

* ---------------- Supplies / references ----------------
VCC   VCC  0   DC 5
VREF  REF  0   DC 2.5          ; mid-supply reference for gain network

* ---------------- Signal source ------------------------
* 10 mV amplitude, 1 kHz sine on a 2.5 V DC bias
VIN   IN   0   SINE(2.5 10m 1k 0 0 0) AC 1

* ---------------- Amplifier ----------------------------
XU1   IN  FB  VCC  0  OUT  AD8551

* Non-inverting gain: 1 + RF/RG = 1 + 99k/1k = 100 V/V = 40 dB
RF    OUT  FB   99k
RG    FB   REF  1k

* Light load
RL    OUT  0    100k
CL    OUT  0    10p

* ---------------- Analysis -----------------------------
.tran 0 5m 0 1u

.meas TRAN vmax MAX V(OUT) FROM 2m TO 5m
.meas TRAN vmin MIN V(OUT) FROM 2m TO 5m
.meas TRAN vout_amp PARAM (vmax-vmin)/2
.meas TRAN gain_db PARAM 20*log10(((vmax-vmin)/2)/10m)

.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7
.end
